# --- Phase 2: VLM server ----------------------------------------------------

# Model weights are ~1.9 GB and are fetched from HuggingFace (GUIDE.md 3.1).
# Ignore the whole directory rather than listing formats: a resumed curl leaves
# *.gguf.part behind and a retry leaves *.gguf.1, and either one is a gigabyte
# nobody meant to commit. SHA256SUMS is the part worth keeping -- it is how a
# download gets verified without shipping the files.
models/*
!models/SHA256SUMS
*.gguf

# Everything the VLM path reads or writes. test_api.py recreates output/ on
# demand, so nothing here needs to exist in a fresh clone.
vlm/data/

# Redundant with the bare `.env` above, kept explicit because this is the file
# that holds machine-specific model paths and context sizes.
docker/.env
